    "text": "northwestmoinfo.com\nwebsite\nGentry County, Missouri\nMoDOT Announces Gentry County Roadwork Planned Friday\n2 hours ago\nThe Missouri Department of Transportation says Route F in Gentry County, southwest of Gentry will close on Friday for a culvert replacement. Route F will be closed at 277th Street from 8am until 3pm Friday. Motorists should seek an alternate route during the closure. MoDOT also announced that a multi-county...",
